---
/** September Club preview: one personalized reset trigger, child-facing front and parent-facing back. */
interface Props {storageKey?:string}
const {storageKey='omc:preview:september-room-reset:v2'}=Astro.props;
---
<div class="srr" data-srr-key={storageKey}>
 <header class="srr-intro">
  <a href="/club">← Organized Family Club</a>
  <p class="srr-eyebrow">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · SEPTEMBER 2027</p>
  <h1>Less asking. <em>More doing.</em></h1>
  <p>A ready-to-use reset for the mess you ask about again and again. One recognizable cue, age-appropriate cleanup jobs, and a finish line kids can recognize.</p>
 </header>
 <div class="srr-layout">
  <aside class="srr-editor" aria-label="Prepared September room reset">
   <div class="srr-editor-head"><p class="srr-eyebrow">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · SEPTEMBER 2027</p><h2>Less asking. <em>More doing.</em></h2><button type="button" class="srr-edit-link" data-open-vision>Why this matters <svg aria-hidden="true" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 5 4 4M4 20l4-.8L19 8.2a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3-3L5 16.2 4 20Z"/></svg></button></div>
   <div class="srr-prepared" id="september-edit-controls"><span class="srr-eyebrow">YOUR FAMILY'S PREPARED RESET</span><strong>Our Daily Reset</strong><p>One noticeable cue, simple age-appropriate cleanup jobs, and a clear finish line your kids can recognize.</p>
     <div class="srr-summary-row"><span>Person responsible</span><b data-srr-summary-owner>Our kids together</b></div>
     <div class="srr-summary-row"><span>Cleanup area</span><b data-srr-summary-area>Bedroom floor</b></div>
     <div class="srr-summary-row"><span>When to start</span><b data-srr-summary-trigger>After our afternoon snack</b></div>
     <button type="button" class="srr-edit-link" data-open-editor>Edit our reset <svg aria-hidden="true" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 5 4 4M4 20l4-.8L19 8.2a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3-3L5 16.2 4 20Z"/></svg></button>
   </div>
   <p class="srr-compact-note">Practice together once, then let kids check the pictures. Adults may still need to help younger children begin.</p>
   <div class="srr-actions"><div class="srr-primary-actions"><a class="srr-jump-edit" href="#september-edit-controls">Make changes <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7"/></svg></a><button class="srr-primary" type="button" data-srr-print>Print / Save PDF</button></div>
     <button class="srr-secondary" type="button" data-srr-png>Download front as image (PNG)</button>
     <button class="srr-restore" type="button" data-srr-reset>Restore prepared plan</button>
   </div>
  </aside>
  <dialog class="srr-dialog" data-srr-vision aria-labelledby="srr-vision-title">
   <div class="srr-dialog-head"><h2 id="srr-vision-title">Why this matters</h2><button type="button" data-close-dialog aria-label="Close">×</button></div>
   <p>Mom shouldn't have to notice every mess, start every cleanup, and check every job. This prepared reset gives children a recognizable cue and a clear finish line so they can gradually take responsibility for one space.</p>
   <button type="button" class="srr-dialog-done" data-close-dialog>Back to our plan</button>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="srr-dialog srr-guided-dialog" data-srr-editor aria-labelledby="srr-editor-title">
   <div class="srr-dialog-head"><div><span class="srr-guide-kicker">MAKE IT YOURS · SEPTEMBER</span><h2 id="srr-editor-title">Our family cleanup</h2></div><button type="button" data-close-dialog aria-label="Close">×</button></div>
   <p class="srr-guide-intro">We've prepared your family's plan. Just change what doesn't fit.</p>
   <section class="srr-guide-section"><h3>When should cleanup happen?</h3>
    <div class="srr-choice-grid" data-srr-trigger-choices>
     <button type="button" data-srr-trigger-choice="Before Dinner">Before Dinner</button>
     <button type="button" data-srr-trigger-choice="After Dinner">After Dinner</button>
     <button type="button" data-srr-trigger-choice="Before Bedtime">Before Bedtime</button>
     <button type="button" data-srr-trigger-choice="After School">After School</button>
     <button type="button" data-srr-trigger-choice="Before the Next Play Activity">Before the Next Play Activity</button>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section class="srr-guide-section"><h3>Where are we cleaning up?</h3>
    <div class="srr-choice-grid srr-area-choices">
     <button type="button" data-srr-area-choice="whole"><span aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>Whole House</button>
     <button type="button" data-srr-area-choice="bedroom"><span aria-hidden="true">▱</span>Bedroom</button>
     <button type="button" data-srr-area-choice="playroom"><span aria-hidden="true">▦</span>Playroom</button>
     <button type="button" data-srr-area-choice="living"><span aria-hidden="true">▤</span>Living Room</button>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section class="srr-guide-section"><div class="srr-guide-caption"><h3>Your family's cleanup jobs</h3><span>Prepared for you</span></div><p class="srr-guide-tip">Choose a different job or person only if needed.</p><div class="srr-guide-jobs" data-srr-guided-jobs></div></section>
   <details class="srr-guide-more"><summary>More options</summary><label>Other cleanup time <select data-srr-other-trigger><option value="">Choose another cue</option><option value="After our afternoon snack">After our afternoon snack</option><option value="When our daily cleanup alarm rings">When our daily cleanup alarm rings</option><option value="When screen time ends">When screen time ends</option></select></label><p>A familiar daily event works better than another exact time to remember.</p></details>
   <p class="srr-guide-saved">✓ Changes save automatically for your family</p>
   <button type="button" class="srr-dialog-done" data-close-dialog>Done · See our plan</button>
  </dialog>
  <section class="srr-preview"><button type="button" class="srr-floating-edit" data-open-editor><svg aria-hidden="true" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 5 4 4M4 20l4-.8L19 8.2a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3-3L5 16.2 4 20Z"/></svg><span>MAKE CHANGES</span></button>
   
   <div class="srr-stage" data-srr-stage>
    <div class="srr-pages" data-srr-pages>
     <article class="srr-sheet srr-front" data-srr-front>
      <header class="srr-paper-head">
       <p>ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · SEPTEMBER 2027</p>
       <h2>Our Daily Reset</h2>
       <span data-srr-owner contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Edit owner">Our family's whole-house cleanup</span>
      </header>
      <section class="srr-trigger-box">
       <span>WHEN DO WE START?</span>
       <h3 data-srr-cue contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Edit cue">Before Dinner</h3>
       <p data-srr-duration contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Edit duration">We put our things away before moving on.</p>
      </section>
      <h3 class="srr-section-title" data-srr-count contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Edit count">Three things. Then we’re done.</h3>
      <div class="srr-jobs" data-srr-jobs>
       <div class="srr-job"><div class="srr-icon"><img data-srr-icon="0" src="/images/club/icon-library/toys-in-toy-basket.png" alt="" width="112" height="112" /></div><span class="srr-number">01</span><strong data-srr-job-label="0" contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Edit cleanup job">Toys in their homes</strong></div>
       <div class="srr-job"><div class="srr-icon"><img data-srr-icon="1" src="/images/club/icon-library/sorting-clothes.png" alt="" width="112" height="112" /></div><span class="srr-number">02</span><strong data-srr-job-label="1" contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Edit cleanup job">Clothes in Hamper</strong></div>
       <div class="srr-job"><div class="srr-icon"><img data-srr-icon="2" src="/images/club/icon-library/clear-floor.png" alt="" width="112" height="112" /></div><span class="srr-number">03</span><strong data-srr-job-label="2" contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Edit cleanup job">Floor Vacuum-Ready</strong></div>
      </div><p class="srr-start" data-srr-start contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Edit start">Start with the toys nearest your feet.</p>
      <section class="srr-done">
       <h3>How do we know it's finished?</h3>
       <p data-srr-finish contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Edit finish">Toys, clothes, and belongings are put away. The floor is vacuum-ready.</p>
       <div class="srr-checks" data-srr-checks><span>✓ Toys away</span><span>✓ Clothes away</span><span>✓ Clear floor</span></div>
      </section>
      <footer class="srr-paper-foot"><strong>Notice the cue. Reset. Then play.</strong><span>NOTICE THE MOMENT · DO MY PART · FINISH THE JOB</span></footer>
     </article>
     <article class="srr-sheet srr-back" data-srr-back>
      <header class="srr-paper-head"><p>ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · SEPTEMBER 2027</p><h2>Let the Routine Remind Them</h2><span>Remind → Help Start → Let Them Finish</span></header>
      <section class="srr-rollout">
  <div><span>STEP 1</span><h3>Remind Them of Their Job</h3><p data-srr-coaching-cue>It’s almost dinnertime. Let’s get our cleanup jobs done.</p></div>
  <div><span>STEP 2</span><h3>Help Them Begin if Needed</h3><p>Try: “Let’s find the first three toys that need to go away.” Help with the start, not the whole job.</p></div>
  <div><span>STEP 3</span><h3>Let Them Finish on Their Own</h3><p>Once they start, let them complete their job. Point to what finished looks like instead of doing it for them.</p></div>
 </section><section class="srr-parent-grid">
  <div><h3>If they resist</h3><p>Stay calm. Remind them of your agreed cleanup time and their specific job. Help them begin if needed.</p></div>
  <div><h3>If they get distracted</h3><p>Gently redirect them to their job. Name one small next action, then let them finish.</p></div>
 </section><section class="srr-parent-promise"><h3>Fewer reminders, over time</h3><p>Start small. Kids may still need reminders, but a familiar cue and clear finish line reduce how much Mom has to direct.</p></section>
      <section class="srr-parent-note"><h3>A note from Megan</h3><p>Start with the belongings your kids leave around the house. A clear cue and a clear finish line help them learn to put their things away without you managing every step.</p></section>
      <footer class="srr-back-foot">ONE FAMILY · ONE DAILY RESET · LESS REMINDING</footer>
     </article>
    </div>
   </div>
  </section>
 </div>
</div>
<style is:global>
.srr,.srr *{box-sizing:border-box}.srr{max-width:1480px;margin:auto;padding:27px clamp(18px,3.5vw,52px) 70px;color:#484941;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif}
.srr-intro{max-width:780px;margin-bottom:34px}.srr-intro>a{font-size:12px;color:#43493f;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:25px}.srr-eyebrow{font-size:10px!important;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:700;color:#718569}.srr-intro h1{font:400 clamp(38px,4.4vw,60px)/1.14 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0}.srr-intro h1 em{color:#788e72}.srr-intro>p:last-child{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75}
.srr-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(275px,350px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(25px,4vw,60px);align-items:start}
.srr-editor{border-top:8px solid #d8e6df;padding-top:16px}.srr-editor h2{font:italic 30px Georgia,serif;color:#668075;margin:10px 0}.srr-editor>p:nth-of-type(2){font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}.srr-editor label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin:18px 0}.srr-editor select,.srr-editor input{display:block;margin-top:7px;width:100%;padding:10px;min-height:44px;color:#454545;background:#fff;border:1px solid #b8c5bd;font:12px Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif}.srr-cue-help{font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;color:#718073;margin:8px 0 15px}.srr-editor details{border:1px solid #d7e1dc;border-radius:6px;padding:0 13px;margin:22px 0}.srr-editor summary{padding:15px 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.srr-editor summary span{font-weight:400;font-size:11px;color:#849289}.srr-note{background:#f3f5ef;padding:17px;margin:20px 0}.srr-note strong{font:21px Georgia,serif}.srr-note p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;margin:7px 0 0}.srr-primary,.srr-secondary{width:100%;min-height:48px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.srr-primary{border:0;background:#5f7767;color:#fff}.srr-secondary{border:1px solid #b7c9bc;background:#fff;color:#5f7767;margin-top:9px}.srr-restore{display:block;margin:8px auto;background:none;border:0;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;color:#607867;min-height:40px}.srr-small{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#858982}
.srr-preview{min-width:0}.srr-preview-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid #e1e6e3;margin-bottom:17px}.srr-preview-heading h2{font:26px Georgia,serif}.srr-preview-heading span{font-size:11px;color:#858982}
.srr-stage{width:100%}.srr-pages{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;align-items:flex-start}.srr-sheet{position:relative;width:816px;height:1056px;transform:scale(var(--srr-scale,1));transform-origin:top left;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid #e6e6e0;box-shadow:0 8px 26px #0002;background:#fff;padding:42px 52px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}.srr-paper-head{text-align:center;padding:12px 10px 20px;border-top:7px solid #deeae4}.srr-paper-head>p{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:700;color:#7c9085;margin:0}.srr-paper-head h2{font:400 45px/1.1 Georgia,serif;color:#506255;margin:14px 0 10px}.srr-paper-head span{font:italic 17px Georgia,serif;color:#849487}
.srr-trigger-box{margin:25px 0;background:#dfeae3;border-radius:12px;padding:26px;text-align:center}.srr-trigger-box>span{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;color:#617d67}.srr-trigger-box h3{font:400 31px Georgia,serif;color:#4b6855;margin:12px 0}.srr-trigger-box p{font-size:14px;color:#66786b;margin:0}.srr-section-title{text-align:center;font:28px Georgia,serif;color:#57594d;margin:17px 0 21px}
.srr-jobs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}.srr-job{min-height:245px;border-radius:12px;background:#faf5eb;padding:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-direction:column;text-align:center}.srr-job:nth-child(2){background:#f1e6de}.srr-job:nth-child(3){background:#edf2ec}.srr-icon{height:126px;width:126px;display:grid;place-items:center}.srr-icon img{width:112px;height:112px;object-fit:contain}.srr-number{font:italic 15px Georgia,serif;color:#8c937d;margin:0 0 12px}.srr-job strong{font-size:16px;line-height:1.35;color:#4d5a4d}.srr-job-owner{display:block;font:700 11px/1.35 Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;color:#607665;margin-top:9px}.srr-owner-plain{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-weight:500;color:#52685a}
.srr-jobs.srr-two{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);max-width:485px;margin:auto}.srr-job[hidden]{display:none!important}.srr-start{text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#607665;margin:16px 0 0}.srr-done{margin-top:28px;border:1px solid #d6dfd7;border-radius:12px;padding:22px 24px;text-align:center}.srr-done h3{font:27px Georgia,serif;color:#506255;margin:0 0 9px}.srr-done p{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 16px;color:#66786b}.srr-checks{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.srr-checks span{background:#edf3ec;padding:8px 11px;border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#506b54}
.srr-paper-foot{margin-top:auto;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #dee5dd;padding-top:19px}.srr-paper-foot strong{display:block;font:italic 23px Georgia,serif;color:#65806c}.srr-paper-foot span,.srr-back-foot{display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;color:#9ca99f;text-align:center}
.srr-rollout{display:grid;gap:10px;margin:18px 0}.srr-rollout>div{background:#f7f7f2;padding:15px 18px;border-radius:9px}.srr-rollout span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700;color:#7c9982}.srr-rollout h3{font:22px Georgia,serif;color:#52685a;margin:4px 0}.srr-rollout p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;color:#596259}.srr-parent-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin:14px 0}.srr-parent-grid>div{background:#f7f7f2;border-radius:9px;padding:17px;min-height:128px}.srr-step{font:italic 23px Georgia,serif;color:#91a692}.srr-parent-grid h3{font:20px Georgia,serif;color:#52685a;margin:8px 0}.srr-parent-grid p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#596259;margin:0}.srr-parent-promise{background:#e2ede5;padding:17px 20px;border-radius:10px}.srr-parent-promise h3,.srr-parent-note h3{font:25px Georgia,serif;color:#506255;margin:0 0 9px}.srr-parent-promise p,.srr-parent-note p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;color:#596259}.srr-parent-note{padding:14px 8px;margin-top:8px}.srr-parent-note p{font-style:italic}.srr-back-foot{margin-top:auto;padding-top:15px;border-top:1px solid #dce5dd}
.srr.srr-export .srr-sheet{transform:none!important;box-shadow:none!important}
